<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>If I Am With You</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">ç…§äº•é †æ”¿</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Jujutsu Kaisen Hidden Inventory/Premature Death - Original Soundtrack</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3kTia7ayynt7DvMq1y77jC</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">2 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If I Lost You Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[start]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I see</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your hand in mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Then I saw your</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Face and your smile</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Then I felt</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This new feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And my hearts beating</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lost in my own mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Then I felt this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">For the first time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I don’t know what to tell you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All about</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And everytime I see you walk</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don’t want you to get this far</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause what would happen if I let you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go off my hand I never felt</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like this before &lt;3</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I don’t want to</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Leave your side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I (oh~)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I don’t want you to leave my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What would if I lost you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">See how?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m looking at you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I see</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Something in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sparkles</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That will never reflect in my еyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Love you like no-body еlse</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Would you please accept?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My new feelings for you baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don’t want you to leave my hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause what would happen if I lost you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[end &gt;:3]</p></div></body></tt>